# Settings

Read theme and app settings with `getSettings()`. Do not import `default.json` from a page or component. UI and templates do not call `getSettings()`; they use Tailwind token classes.

Token **values** live in `src/settings/default.json`. `getSettings()` merges any overlay onto those defaults. CSS variable **names** and fallbacks live in `src/app/globals.css`. The locale layout injects `toCssVars(settings.theme)` on `<html>`.

Scales: `theme.colors` (background, foreground, border, panel, primary, accent 1–4, success, warning, error). Action colors are `{ base, foreground, hover }`. `theme.radius` (`sm`–`full`), `theme.borderWidth` (`sm`–`lg`). Breakpoints stay in `globals.css`, not here. Do not scatter hex in UI or templates. Do not add unused settings keys. Locale list and routing stay in `src/i18n/config.ts` — not here.

Storage swap is `loadSettingsFromJson` in `get-settings.ts`. Follow [docs/content.md](docs/content.md). If this summary changes, update `CLAUDE.md` Layout in the same turn.
